cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use FlockLake, please cite it as below. Please also cite the data
  sources you used (see docs/research/data-sources.md) and the methods listed
  under references.
type: software
title: "FlockLake: an open radar-aeroecology data platform"
abstract: >-
  FlockLake turns public weather-radar data from Europe and the US into
  quality-checked, lineage-tracked data products about migrating birds:
  densities, flight altitudes, speeds and directions, and nightly migration
  traffic, using transparent, physics-based methods.
authors:
  - family-names: Mohammadpour
    given-names: Soheil
repository-code: "https://github.com/soheil-mp/flocklake"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - weather radar
  - bird migration
  - aeroecology
  - vertical profiles
  - data engineering
  - open data
